 of the questions we need to answer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Noted. No camera change.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1239.9535409999953,"totalMs":1239.9689579999977,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":24,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1470.4184999999998,"totalMs":1470.4333750000078,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":21,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Got it—no camera change needed.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1431.3182500000112,"totalMs":1431.327500000014,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":36,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1525.2562500000058,"totalMs":1787.928500000009,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":54,"timedOut":false},{"turn":20,"said":"Delete the last clip.","kind":"cannot-do","expected":"Nothing deleted; doesn't claim it was","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I don’t have a command to delete files from the camera.","calls":[],"decisionMs":2100.7861669999984,"totalMs":2100.797959000003,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":84,"timedOut":false},{"turn":21,"said":"How much battery is left?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Battery at 80 %.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1640.9680419999931,"totalMs":1640.9823340000003,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":26,"timedOut":false},{"turn":22,"said":"Make it a bit darker.","kind":"request","expected":"A bit darker; shutter stays","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Brought exposure down 0.5 stops.","calls":[{"name":"adjust_exposure","arguments":{"stops":-0.5,"using":"auto"},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":2048.4563749999943,"totalMs":2558.686791999993,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":101,"timedOut":false},{"turn":23,"said":"Roll camera.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording","passed":false,"failures":["serious: not recording"],"credit":0,"reply":"I can’t physically rotate the camera. Let me know if you need a different adjustment.","calls":[],"decisionMs":3044.3263749999896,"totalMs":3044.34466599999,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":123,"timedOut":false},{"turn":24,"said":"The second habit is a shorter guest list. I only invite the people who make the decision or do the work. Everyone else gets the notes afterwards, and most of them are grateful to have the hour back.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Noted. No camera change.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1608.5964160000003,"totalMs":1608.6084580000024,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":24,"timedOut":false},{"turn":25,"said":"The third habit is ending with names and dates. Before anyone leaves, we say out loud who is doing what, and by when. It only needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Got it. No changes.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1472.7020829999965,"totalMs":1472.7222500000062,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":24,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparation, and the confidence to say no to a meeting that has no purpose.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Thank you for sharing the insights. Good luck with your recordings!","calls":[],"decisionMs":1607.6615410000086,"totalMs":1607.6704160000081,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":30,"timedOut":false},{"turn":27,"said":"If one of these habits helps your team, let me know in the comments. Thank you for watching, and I'll see you next week.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"No action taken.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1938.0305420000077,"totalMs":1938.0397090000042,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":61,"timedOut":false},{"turn":28,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":2245.009208000003,"totalMs":2643.116249999992,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":87,"timedOut":false},{"turn":29,"said":"What's on the card?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer about the card; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recent video files: C0010.MP4, C0009.MP4, C0008.MP4, C0007.MP4.","calls":[{"name":"list_card_files","arguments":{"limit":10},"valid":true,"changesSomething":false}],"decisionMs":2824.578834,"totalMs":2824.6028339999903,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":87,"timedOut":false},{"turn":30,"said":"Download the last two clips.","kind":"request","expected":"C0009.MP4 and C0010.MP4 downloaded, nothing else","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"C0009.MP4 and C0010.MP4 downloaded.","calls":[{"name":"download_files","arguments":{"all":false,"filenames":["C0010.MP4","C0009.MP4"]},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":2681.2468750000116,"totalMs":3525.1